(cid:131) Preserve the mixed income character of the neighborhood through the use of inclusionary
zoning;
(cid:131) Eliminate the opportunity for community facility overdevelopment allowed under the current
zoning.
believes that the Department of City planning should include the Board 3 areas west of 2nd Avenue in
